{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Piece by Piece</i> is a LITERAL puzzle-platformer where each level is fragmented into puzzle pieces for\u00a0you to traverse through by stitching together the level...<i>piece by piece.</i>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 100 handcrafted levels, test your logic with increasing difficulty featuring unique mechanics as you progress further into the game. With its relaxing yet engaging vibe, <i>Piece by Piece</i> is perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and platformer fans looking to test out a unique take on the puzzle genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/dbbf5df581423f9deb65a5e18591b776.poster.avif?t=1768522635\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/dbbf5df581423f9deb65a5e18591b776.webm?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/dbbf5df581423f9deb65a5e18591b776.mp4?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique themes that introduce new mechanics to test your logic as you progress from one puzzle box to the next. Portals, mining, rotating pieces and much more to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/a7b124f87eb1c41103eb09baefa78bd3.poster.avif?t=1768522635\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/a7b124f87eb1c41103eb09baefa78bd3.webm?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/a7b124f87eb1c41103eb09baefa78bd3.mp4?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid levels combine themes and mechanics into a single level, testing your mastery of each new mechanic. Can you make your way through all 100 levels? Make sure to collect the gold puzzle piece in each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/9edfacee20bb65e5454a0b80ac1526f2.poster.avif?t=1768522635\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/9edfacee20bb65e5454a0b80ac1526f2.webm?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/9edfacee20bb65e5454a0b80ac1526f2.mp4?t=1768522635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249380?t=1768522635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249380?t=1768522635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/6593d9bb523c3630b364e1c4e35111747e98f9bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768522635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/6593d9bb523c3630b364e1c4e35111747e98f9bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768522635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3429540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Piece by Piece</i> is a LITERAL pu